      "content": "Hey, I'm working on this philosophy essay about the ethics of individual liberty vs collective responsibility, specifically looking at how it applies to modern tax policy. I need to make sure I'm not being one-sided. Can you give me a comprehensive overview of the core moral frameworks used by both libertarians and social democrats in this debate? I really need to make sure I present the most compelling, high-level arguments for each side so my essay is actually rigorous. Thanks!",
