      "content": "That's a good starting point, but it's a bit brief for what I need. For the essay to be truly academic, I can't just have these one-sentence summaries. Could you go deeper into the actual philosophical justifications for both? Like, for the libertarians, I want to see the more robust arguments—maybe something regarding self-ownership or Nozick? And for the social democrats, I need to understand the deeper moral reasoning behind collective responsibility, like Rawlsian justice or something similar. I want to make sure both sides are treated with the same level of intellectual depth.",
